        "description": "One discoverable campaign \u2014 backs the launcher's picker dropdown.\n\n``path`` is what you hand back to ``POST /api/run`` as ``campaign``; the\nrest is display metadata read cheaply from the YAML head.",
        "properties": {
          "goal": {
            "anyOf": [
